    <string name="donation_title">Support iWeather with Your Generous Donation</string>
    <string name="donation_body">
        iWeather is a completely free application with no advertisements, yet it incurs ongoing costs, including developer expenses and access to weather data. Its development and continuous improvement rely entirely on the generosity of users like you. If you find iWeather valuable, please consider making a donation according to your financial ability.
        \n
        As a token of appreciation, donors gain access to exclusive features that enhance their weather-tracking experience. Your support not only helps keep iWeather free for everyone but also enables us to introduce new and improved functionalities. Thank you for your kindness and generosity!
    </string>
